The timeline illustrates the development of seismic attributes and their relationship to key advances in seismic exploration technology. It shows events such as the introduction of seismic attributes, digital recording of seismic data, seismic data in color, seismic inversion, complex trace analysis, response attributes, crossplotting of attributes, classification of attributes, pattern recognition and neural network analysis on attributes, texture attributes, and multiattribute analysis. Source: gsgpy_70_5_3SO.pdf — page 3.

